# Every text file is stored and checked out with LF, whatever the contributor's
# platform or `core.autocrlf` setting. Without this a Windows checkout rewrites
# the tree as CRLF and `prettier/prettier` then fails on every line of every
# file — around 5000 errors across 91 files, none of them real.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Assets are bytes; normalising them would corrupt them.
*.png binary
*.webp binary
